text:
Here's a complete, self-contained HTML landing page for Dune Line, the fictional overnight desert train. It includes a navigation bar, a hero with a code-drawn desert-to-neon-city scene, three feature cards, a timetable, three pricing tiers, a testimonial, and a footer — all styled to look sharp at 1280px.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Dune Line — Overnight across the Erg of Miren</title>
<meta name="description" content="Dune Line runs one nightly sleeper across the desert to Neon City. Private berths, the Saffron dining car, arrival at first glow.">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0a0810;
    --surface:#120e1b;
    --line:rgba(233,207,168,.13);
    --line-strong:rgba(233,207,168,.28);
    --text:#f5efe6;
    --muted:#a99cb2;
    --sand:#e9cfa8;
    --sand-2:#c48b55;
    --neon:#ff4fa3;
    --cyan:#5ce9dd;
    --serif:"Iowan Old Style","Palatino Linotype",Palatino,Georgia,ui-serif,serif;
    --sans:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
  }
  *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{
    margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);
    font-family:var(--sans);font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;text-rendering:optimizeLegibility;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  [hidden]{display:none!important}
  body::before{
    content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(900px 620px at 10% -6%, rgba(255,79,163,.17), transparent 62%),
      radial-gradient(820px 600px at 94% 4%, rgba(92,233,221,.10), transparent 62%),
      radial-gradient(1100px 820px at 50% 112%, rgba(196,139,85,.13), transparent 66%);
  }
  body::after{
    content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;opacity:.3;
    background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(233,207,168,.22) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size:34px 34px;
    -webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(1200px 820px at 50% 0%, #000 10%, transparent 78%);
    mask-image:radial-gradient(1200px 820px at 50% 0%, #000 10%, transparent 78%);
  }
  header,main,footer{position:relative;z-index:1}
  a{color:inherit}
  img,svg{display:block;max-width:100%}
  ::selection{background:rgba(255,79,163,.35);color:#fff}
  :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--cyan);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:6px}
  .skip{
    position:absolute;left:16px;top:-60px;z-index:100;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:0 0 10px 10px;
    background:var(--sand);color:#160f08;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;transition:top .2s;
  }
  .skip:focus{top:0}
  .wrap{width:min(100% - 48px, 1200px);margin-inline:auto}

  /* ---------- type ---------- */
  h1,h2,h3,blockquote{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500}
  .eyebrow{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:0;
    font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sand);
  }
  .eyebrow::before{content:"";width:26px;height:1px;background:currentColor;opacity:.6}
  .lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;max-width:52ch;margin:0}
  em.grad{
    font-style:italic;color:transparent;
    background:linear-gradient(100deg,#ff9ec7,#ffd7a1 48%,#8ff0e6);
    -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;
  }

  /* ---------- buttons ---------- */
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;
    border-radius:999px;padding:14px 26px;border:1px solid transparent;
    font:inherit;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.005em;
    text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .25s, box-shadow .25s, background .25s, border-color .25s, color .25s;
  }
  .btn-primary{
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f6e0bd,#dfb07c);color:#1a1108;
    box-shadow:0 10px 28px -12px rgba(233,207,168,.7);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 16px 34px -14px rgba(233,207,168,.85)}
  .btn-ghost{border-color:var(--line-strong);color:var(--text);background:rgba(255,255,255,.02)}
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--sand);background:rgba(233,207,168,.09);transform:translateY(-2px)}
  .btn-sm{padding:10px 18px;font-size:13.5px}

  /* ---------- nav ---------- */
  .nav{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto;z-index:70;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s,backdrop-filter .35s;border-bottom:1px solid transparent}
  .nav.scrolled{background:rgba(10,8,16,.78);backdrop-filter:blur(16px) saturate(140%);border-bottom-color:var(--line)}
  .nav-inner{width:min(100% - 48px,1200px);margin-inline:auto;height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px}
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--sand)}
  .mark{width:30px;height:30px;color:var(--sand);flex:none}
  .brand-txt{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1}
  .brand-txt b{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:19px;letter-spacing:.01em;color:var(--text);font-weight:600}
  .brand-txt i{font-family:var(--sans);font-style:normal;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px}
  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:30px;margin-left:auto}
  .nav-links a{font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);transition:color .2s;position:relative;padding:4px 0}
  .nav-links a::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:100%;bottom:0;height:1px;background:var(--sand);transition:right .3s}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--text)}
  .nav-links a:hover::after{right:0}
  .nav-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-left:8px}
  .menu-btn{
    display:none;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background:transparent;cursor:pointer;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:5px;
  }
  .menu-btn span{width:16px;height:1.5px;background:var(--text);border-radius:2px}
  .mobile-menu{
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(12,9,20,.97);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
    padding:14px 24px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;
  }
  .mobile-menu a{padding:12px 4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--text);font-size:15px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(233,207,168,.08)}
  .mobile-menu a:last-child{border-bottom:0}

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{padding:136px 0 84px}
  .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.03fr .97fr;gap:clamp(32px,5vw,70px);align-items:center}
  h1{font-size:clamp(42px,5.3vw,72px);line-height:.99;letter-spacing:-.032em;margin:20px 0 0}
  .hero p.lead{margin-top:22px;font-size:17.5px}
  .hero-cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:32px}
  .stats{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:28px;margin-top:44px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .stat b{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.1}
  .stat span{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}

  .scene-frame{
    position:relative;border-radius:26px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);
    height:clamp(420px,46vw,600px);
    box-shadow:0 50px 90px -50px rgba(255,79,163,.5), 0 20px 50px -30px #000;
  }
  .scene{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}
  .scene-frame::after{
    content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(8,6,14,.42),transparent 26%,transparent 66%,rgba(8,6,14,.72));
  }
  .chip{
    position:absolute;z-index:2;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
    padding:8px 13px;border-radius:999px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sand);
    background:rgba(10,8,16,.6);border:1px solid rgba(233,207,168,.24);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
  }
  .chip.tl{top:16px;left:16px}
  .chip.br{bottom:16px;right:16px}
  .dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(92,233,221,.6);animation:pulse 2.4s ease-out infinite}
  @keyframes pulse{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(92,233,221,.55)}70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 9px rgba(92,233,221,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(92,233,221,0)}}
  .tw{animation:tw 4.5s ease-in-out infinite}
  .tw:nth-child(3n){animation-delay:1.4s}
  .tw:nth-child(4n){animation-delay:2.9s}
  @keyframes tw{0%,100%{opacity:.25}50%{opacity:.95}}

  /* ---------- sections ---------- */
  .sec{padding:86px 0}
  .sec-head{max-width:660px;margin-bottom:44px}
  h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3.5vw,46px);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.028em;margin:16px 0 16px}

  .route-line{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;overflow-x:auto;padding:2px 0 40px;scrollbar-width:none}
  .route-line::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
  .stop{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;min-width:max-content}
  .stop b{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .stop i{font-family:var(--sans);font-style:normal;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--muted)}
  .stop-dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid var(--sand);margin-bottom:3px}
  .stop:last-child .stop-dot{background:var(--neon);border-color:var(--neon);box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(255,79,163,.8)}
  .rail{flex:1;min-width:44px;height:1px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--line-strong) 0 5px,transparent 5px 11px)}

  .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
  .card{
    padding:26px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.045),rgba(255,255,255,.012));
    transition:transform .3s,border-color .3s,background .3s;
  }
  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:rgba(233,207,168,.34);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(233,207,168,.09),rgba(255,255,255,.015))}
  .icon{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:13px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--sand);border:1px solid var(--line-strong);background:rgba(233,207,168,.07)}
  .card h3{font-size:21px;margin:18px 0 8px;letter-spacing:-.012em}
  .card p{margin:0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.66;color:var(--muted)}

  /* ---------- timetable ---------- */
  .deps{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .dep{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.55fr .85fr 1.15fr .8fr .65fr auto;
    gap:16px;align-items:center;padding:19px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:14px;transition:background .25s,box-shadow .25s;
  }
  .dep:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.032)}
  .dep[data-selected="true"]{
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,79,163,.15),rgba(255,79,163,.03));
    box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,79,163,.38);
  }
  .dep-code{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--sand)}
  .dep-route{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:16.5px;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-top:3px}
  .dep-time b{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .dep-time i{font-style:normal;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-left:6px}
  .dep-class{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted)}
  .status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .status::before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}
  .status.ok{color:var(--cyan)}
  .status.warn{color:#ffb35c}
  .status.off{color:#7d7488}
  .dep-price{text-align:right}
  .dep-price b{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .dep-price i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
  .pick{
    border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);background:transparent;color:var(--text);
    font:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:650;padding:9px 18px;cursor:pointer;transition:.22s;white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .pick:hover{border-color:var(--sand);background:rgba(233,207,168,.1)}
  .dep[data-selected="true"] .pick{background:var(--neon);border-color:var(--neon);color:#180510}
  .pick[disabled]{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}
  .pick[disabled]:hover{background:transparent;border-color:var(--line-strong)}

  /* ---------- pricing ---------- */
  .tiers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;align-items:stretch}
  .tier{
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:28px;border-radius:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.04),rgba(255,255,255,.012));
  }
  .tier.best{
    border-color:rgba(255,79,163,.45);
    background:radial-gradient(140% 90% at 50% 0%, rgba(255,79,163,.16), transparent 62%), rgba(255,255,255,.025);
    box-shadow:0 40px 70px -50px rgba(255,79,163,.9);
  }
  .tier-tag{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
  .tier.best .tier-tag{color:var(--neon)}
  .tier h3{font-size:23px;margin:10px 0 4px;letter-spacing:-.015em}
  .price{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:44px;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1;margin:14px 0 4px}
  .price small{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}
  .tier ul{list-style:none;margin:20px 0 26px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
  .tier li{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;line-height:1.5}
  .tier li svg{flex:none;margin-top:3px;color:var(--sand)}
  .tier .btn{margin-top:auto;width:100%}
  .tier-note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:14px 0 0;text-align:center}

  /* ---------- quote ---------- */
  .quote-wrap{
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:26px;padding:clamp(30px,5.2vw,66px);text-align:center;
    background:radial-gradient(120% 130% at 12% 0%, rgba(255,79,163,.11), transparent 58%), rgba(255,255,255,.02);
  }
  blockquote{margin:22px auto 0;max-width:23ch;font-size:clamp(22px,2.9vw,36px);line-height:1.24;letter-spacing:-.022em}
  .stars{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:6px;color:var(--sand)}
  .who{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin-top:28px}
  .avatar{
    width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;
    color:#1a1108;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#f6e0bd,#c48b55);
  }
  .who-txt{text-align:left;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.35}
  .who-txt b{display:block;font-weight:650}
  .who-txt span{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}

  /* ---------- footer ---------- */
  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:64px 0 30px;margin-top:30px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(255,79,163,.045))}
  .foot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.7fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr;gap:36px}
  .foot-grid h4{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px}
  .foot-grid ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
  .foot-grid a{font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--text);opacity:.82;transition:opacity .2s}
  .foot-grid a:hover{opacity:1;color:var(--sand)}
  .foot-blurb{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;max-width:34ch;margin:16px 0 0}
  .sub{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}
  .sub input{
    flex:1;min-width:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius:999px;padding:11px 16px;color:var(--text);font:inherit;font-size:13.5px;
  }
  .sub input::placeholder{color:#7d7488}
  .foot-bottom{
    display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
    margin-top:52px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);
  }
  .foot-bottom nav{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .foot-bottom a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted)}
  .foot-bottom a:hover{color:var(--sand)}

  /* ---------- dock ---------- */
  .dock{
    position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:22px;z-index:80;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;
    padding:11px 13px 11px 20px;border-radius:999px;max-width:calc(100% - 32px);
    background:rgba(18,13,26,.94);border:1px solid rgba(233,207,168,.3);
    backdrop-filter:blur(16px);box-shadow:0 26px 60px -26px #000;
    transform:translate(-50%,150%);transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.3,1);
  }
  .dock.show{transform:translate(-50%,0)}
  .dock p{margin:0;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.02em}
  .dock p b{color:var(--sand);font-weight:650}
  .dock-close{
    width:30px;height:30px;flex:none;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background:transparent;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;font-size:15px;line-height:1;
  }
  .dock-close:hover{color:var(--text);border-color:var(--sand)}

  /* ---------- reveal ---------- */
  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:opacity .75s ease,transform .75s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1)}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}

  /* ---------- responsive ---------- */
  @media (max-width:1080px){
    .nav-links{gap:20px}
    .dep{grid-template-columns:1.4fr .8fr 1fr auto;row-gap:8px}
    .dep-class{grid-column:3}
    .dep-status{grid-column:4;grid-row:1}
    .dep-price{grid-column:2;grid-row:2;text-align:left}
    .pick{grid-column:4;grid-row:2}
    .dep-time{grid-row:2}
  }
  @media (max-width:900px){
    .nav-links{display:none}
    .menu-btn{display:flex}
    .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .scene-frame{order:2;height:clamp(360px,62vw,480px)}
    .hero{padding-top:120px}
    .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .tiers{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .dep{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
    .dep-route{font-size:18px}
    .dep-status{grid-column:2;grid-row:1;justify-self:end}
    .dep-price{grid-column:1;grid-row:3;text-align:left}
    .pick{grid-column:2;grid-row:3;justify-self:end}
    .dep-time{grid-row:2;grid-column:1}
    .dep-class{grid-row:2;grid-column:2;justify-self:end;text-align:right}
  }
  @media (max-width:560px){
    .wrap{width:calc(100% - 36px)}
    .stats{gap:20px}
    .hero-cta .btn{flex:1 1 100%}
    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .foot-bottom{justify-content:flex-start}
    .dep{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .dep-status,.dep-class,.pick{justify-self:start;grid-column:1}
    .dep-status{grid-row:1}
    .dep-class{grid-row:3}
    .dep-price{grid-row:4}
    .pick{grid-row:5;justify-self:stretch;text-align:center}
    .dep-time{grid-row:2}
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    html{scroll-behavior:auto}
    .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none}
    .tw,.dot{animation:none}
    *{transition-duration:.01ms!important}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body id="top">
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

<header class="nav" id="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Dune Line, home">
      <svg class="mark" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round">
        <path d="M2 21c4.5-1 6-6.5 9.5-6.5S16 21 20.5 21 27 16.5 30 15"/>
        <circle cx="24.5" cy="8.5" r="3.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
        <path d="M3 26.5h26" opacity=".45" stroke-width="1.2"/>
      </svg>
      <span class="brand-txt"><b>Dune Line</b><i>overnight railway</i></span>
    </a>
    <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="#route">The route</a>
      <a href="#departures">Departures</a>
      <a href="#fares">Fares</a>
      <a href="#reviews">Reviews</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="#fares">Book a berth</a>
      <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobileMenu" aria-label="Menu">
        <span></span><span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu" hidden>
    <a href="#route">The route</a>
    <a href="#departures">Departures</a>
    <a href="#fares">Fares</a>
    <a href="#reviews">Reviews</a>
